00:00:38.579 --> 00:00:41.879
Number 5 - Bolin Makes Friends with The Red
Lotus

00:00:41.879 --> 00:00:45.679
I love that he got 2 out 3 guesses right.
Based on the way Ming Yua looked away from

00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:49.960
Ghazan when Bolin said there was an unspoken
attraction I think that was one of the correct

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:55.260
ones. Even though I think they wanted us to
think the moustache and sister ones were right.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:00.480
When you listen to Bolin’s guesses again,
he’s really describing Team Korra. Raised

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:04.650
by an older sibling, that’s Bolin being
raised by Mako and unspoken attraction. That’s

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:09.190
kind of Makorra. The red lotus is a twisted
version of team korra. Or if you want to go

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:13.180
way back, a twisted version of team aang,
just because of the shaved head airbending

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:13.920
leader thing.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:19.320
I also got the vibe that Ghazan was the Bolin
of their group. Like the one who gets to react

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:22.960
to everything. If you remember, he was the
one that got the funny reaction when Zaheer

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.500
and Pi Li started making out in their getaway
truck.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:29.610
Bolin’s relentless positivity always makes
me feel better. It’s an animated show, so

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:34.340
his emotions are dialed up to 11 like he’s
super bipolar. But not spongebob levels of

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:36.650
bipolar so it’s not annoying.

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:41.810
That would actually be a cool subform of energy
bending. Emotion Bending. Then you could bend

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:47.650
all of the feels. Overly Friendly Bolin was
my favorite funny moment, but some alternates

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:52.630
were Zuko’s Dragon being lassoed to the
comically small palm tree and the other earthbender

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:55.260
in the cell next to mako and bolin.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.880
Number 4 - Team Korrasami

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:01.660
How awesome are the two of them together this
season? If this were Scooby Doo she would

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:06.560
be like Velma in Daphne’s body and Korra
would be like Shaggy in Fred’s Body. That’s

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.300
not a dig at Korra in any way, it’s just
that I love how the dynamic changes from group

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:17.300
to group depending on who they pair up.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:24.920
Korra is like a linebacker, fearless and ready
to go 24/7. Asami is the one who’s done

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:28.280
the homework. She knows the flaws in the Cabbage
Corp ships.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:32.430
Which by the way was one of the best shade
throwing jokes on Korra this season. Let me

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:36.170
know if you caught it the first time around.
She’s basically throwing shade at cabbage

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.750
corp. Saying they totally suck.

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:42.580
The desert scenes were a whole other story.
They really reminded me of Last Airbender

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:47.430
when they went to the library. Plus the giant
sand fish was a nice reference to Frank Herbert’s

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:51.100
Dune. If you’ve never seen any of the versions
of the movie or read the books you should.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:53.580
It’s some of the best science fiction you’ll
ever find.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.250
The Sci Fi channel turned it into a miniseries
about 10 years ago, but the version most people

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.840
talk about is the David Lynch movie with Kyle
Maclachlan and Sting. I think that’s on

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.830
netflix.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:06.260
Diving into the belly of the beast Number
3 - Korrasami escapes the Whale

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:11.190
I know I just referenced Dune, but you could
also compare this to Pinocchio escaping the

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:18.190
whale and the Millenium Falcon escaping the
space slug in Empire Strikes Back. I don’t

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:24.990
know which reference point Mike and Bryan
were going for but they all work.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:28.950
I think it’s interesting how Korra didn’t
beat the crap out of everyone when the airship

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:31.630
crashed. She just apologized for tricking
the guard.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:35.959
I think this is important foreshadowing for
how people are going to perceive her versus

00:03:35.959 --> 00:03:39.150
Zaheer during the revolution in Ba Sing Se.
If she had taken them all down, she would

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.440
have been no better than Zaheer dominating
the Earth Queen.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.800
This particular instance of Korra kindness
probably won’t make waves or anything, nobody

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:48.530
else was there to see her, so when she gets
to Ba Sing Se with Zuko and the rest of the

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:53.310
group, all Zaheer has to do is show everyone
how agressive she is. Making the red lotus

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:57.050
seem like liberators and anyone else by default
seem like opressors.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:01.060
That’s the problem with being the Avatar,
you’d expect the White Lotus to be running

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:05.959
a PR campaign on your behalf, but right now
it seems like Korra has to sway public opinion

00:04:05.959 --> 00:04:07.650
all by herself.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:13.069
The only other Spin Guy they know that can
command peoples attention is Varrick. I feel

00:04:13.069 --> 00:04:17.019
like he’s going to help them out in some
ridiculous way. Either with his magnets or

00:04:17.019 --> 00:04:21.539
just by turning public opinion in Korra’s
favor using one of his devices.

00:04:21.539 --> 00:04:25.490
On to the oh shit portions of the episode
Number 2 - Zaheer Airbends the oxegyn out

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:29.539
of the Queen’s Lungs
Just to be clear, this was not the sub-form

00:04:29.539 --> 00:04:33.969
of airbending. He was still airbending air.
It’s just a very advanced form of airbending

00:04:33.969 --> 00:04:38.419
because it requires precision. If he hadn’t
been so good at it he would have killed her.

00:04:38.419 --> 00:04:43.259
What he did when he talked about darkness
was just making the Queen pass out from Oxygen

00:04:43.259 --> 00:04:49.240
deprivation. When someone goes without air
in their lungs for more than a few minutes

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.819
oxygen stops circulating to your brain for
a short period and you pass out. Then reflexively,

00:04:52.819 --> 00:04:56.499
your breathing muscles and your lungs start
up again. You can go for about 5 minutes without

00:04:56.499 --> 00:04:59.520
air before things start to get really shitty
for you.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.379
But the human body is designed to automatically
pump air if you faint or pass out. That’s

00:05:03.379 --> 00:05:05.919
usually how people drown. They pass out, then
float underwater, then their body automatically

00:05:05.919 --> 00:05:09.900
starts pumping in air but your underwater
so water gets in your lungs and bam, you drown.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:10.979
That’s how most people die from drowning,
not from lack of air, but from breathing in

00:05:10.979 --> 00:05:11.029
water.

00:05:11.029 --> 00:05:18.009
and my Number 1 WTF moment - The Ba Sing Se
Revolution Begins

00:05:18.009 --> 00:05:24.639
Technically it won’t begin until everyone
loses their shit and starts rioting in the

00:05:24.639 --> 00:05:28.819
streets. Ghazan tore down one of the inner
walls. Probably the one that separated the

00:05:28.819 --> 00:05:33.080
are between where Mako and Bolin’s family
lived and the wealthier inner city where Toph’s

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:33.360
family used to live.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:38.460
That actually makes me wonder if Toph has
any cousins still living there. Her family

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:41.639
was almost as wealthy as the crown. There
would have had to have been a few cousins

00:05:41.639 --> 00:05:42.479
floating around.

00:05:42.479 --> 00:05:49.479
Zaheer is just lighting the match, once Ba
Sing Se riots I think his hope is that the

00:05:50.309 --> 00:05:57.309
revolution will spread to all the other major
cities and everyone will do the work of tearing

00:05:57.409 --> 00:05:58.900
down the governments for him.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:02.680
Which brings up an interesting point. What
does he need Korra for if he can start the

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.069
revolution all by himself?

00:06:04.069 --> 00:06:08.689
Remember how I said he’s probably going
to use her to sway public opinion more in

00:06:08.689 --> 00:06:12.889
favor of revolution. One easy way to do that
would be for Korra to kill him in a very public

00:06:12.889 --> 00:06:16.879
way. He’s already broadcast to everyone
in the city his intentions to liberate them.

00:06:16.879 --> 00:06:20.779
So for them, he’s the good guy. If korra
were to kill him, that would make everyone

00:06:20.779 --> 00:06:22.930
flip out in turbo mode.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:26.979
That doesn’t mean that’s what he wants
her for, I just think it would be a very effective

00:06:26.979 --> 00:06:29.509
way to accomplish his goal. To sacrifice himself.

00:06:29.509 --> 00:06:34.379
But let me know what your favorite moment
was and what do you think he’s going to

00:06:34.379 --> 00:06:35.270
use Korra for?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:39.199
Even those this episode felt a lot smaller
than previous ones I gave it a solid A. The

00:06:39.199 --> 00:06:44.539
animation was god damn beautiful and the character
beats were executed flawlessly. Bolin’s

00:06:44.539 --> 00:06:48.119
funny moments show us that the red lotus are
real people, they’re not crazy villains

00:06:48.119 --> 00:06:53.210
like Unalaq was. Bolin metalbending is going
to be his mount everest to climb in the next

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.240
3 episodes.

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:59.710
I think he’ll do it. As many downers there
are in Korra season to season, all of the

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:01.529
characters usually achieve their big triumph
by the end. Metalbending seems like Bolin’s

00:07:01.529 --> 00:07:02.729
big challenge. And I think it’s more an
issue of him believing in himself. Part of

00:07:02.729 --> 00:07:06.889
the reason I think he talks so much is because
he’s insecure, once he gets over that he’ll

00:07:06.889 --> 00:07:10.219
probably find the inner peace to metal bend
the shit out of everything.

00:07:10.219 --> 00:07:16.379
Zaheer feels like the big question mark right
now. I love how Henry Rollins has created

00:07:16.379 --> 00:07:23.099
this ambiguous antagonist. Notice I didn’t
say villain. From his perspective, the villains

00:07:23.099 --> 00:07:26.930
of the series are the politicians like the
earth queen. So he’s really just the counterbalance

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:27.449
to them.

00:07:27.449 --> 00:07:32.580
The only way Korra will be able to stop things
from going crazy will be to neutralize zaheer,

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:38.869
all the citizens of every nation and the leadership.
No big deal right? That’s just like a million

00:07:38.869 --> 00:07:39.479
different people to pacify.

00:07:39.479 --> 00:07:44.360
Remember that Mike and Bryan said that her
solution this season won’t be based on her

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.669
bending ability. It’s not going to be a
physical fight.

00:07:46.669 --> 00:07:50.749
That’s why I think Book 3 is so much more
interesting than Books 1 and 2. It’s more

00:07:50.749 --> 00:07:54.490
of a philosophical journey than a slap fight.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:08:00.330
Let me know where you think the season will
end? Last year things ended with spirit world

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.069
and the physical realm becoming closer than
ever. It feels like humanity is going to end

00:08:02.069 --> 00:08:02.619
up becoming a lot closer to each other.

00:08:02.619 --> 00:08:04.029
And another big question mark to consider
is what will be the macguffin to carry us

00:08:04.029 --> 00:08:07.189
into book 4? Last year it was the joining
of the spirit and physical realms.

00:08:07.189 --> 00:08:10.490
Here’s a crazy thought, what if all the
nations of the world joined together in a

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:16.279
democracy like Republic City? A republic is
the answer to feudalism. Even if Zaheer hates

00:08:16.279 --> 00:08:17.619
all government.

00:08:17.619 --> 00:08:20.649
Just something to think about. But time to
name a new winner in the weekly giveaway.

